<title>USA: USA Detergents Q4 profits to fall short.</title>
<headline>USA Detergents Q4 profits to fall short.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USA Detergents Inc on Wednesday said it expected its fourth-quarter revenues and profits to fall short of analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The First Call mean earnings estimate was $0.25 per share versus $0.13 per share in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>The company said problems and costs encountered in the rapid expansion of its manufacturing, sales and distribution capabilities in late 1996 hurt its fourth-quarter performance.</p>
<p>The company, which makes laundry and household cleaning products, said it expected to report results within the next 10 days.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
